  governs 2030-01-01..
  known 2026-10-25
  note "the what-if is stated today (the model's on); its row overlaps the base's rate from 2030, so it says replace (L 6.4)"
  replace rate = 0.25 "story: the what-if, the gains tax is 25 % from 1 January 2030"
