  on d2
  reads a4
  leg cash from world to a5 amount bal(a4)

move m1: maybe
  on d1
  reads a6
  leg cash from world to a5 amount bal(a6)

move top: transfers
  on d2
  reads savs
  leg cash from world to a1 amount sum(o.cash.amount for o in savs over s0..d2)

move top0: transfers
  on d1
  reads savs
