,59:fixes/g12/pm6_remeasure_refused_when_remeasure_refused_when,9:fixes-g12,59:run pm6_remeasure_refused_when_remeasure_refused_when.tally,1780:55:pm6_remeasure_refused_when_remeasure_refused_when.tally,1715:model g11_remeasure_refused_when
  tally 2
