  lowest end-of-day balance of zs on 2026-01-15 .. 2026-06-30: 5.00 PLN, on 2026-01-15 (through 2026-06-30)
  balance of zs (PLN) at the end of 2026-01-15
  from: pad statement_01:stated[zs] = -5.00 PLN, 2026-01-15 start (version statement_01, source bank_feed), gap role pad from w_zs, gap -25.00 PLN (pads:statement_01:zs@2026-01-15 start)
  2026-01-15:
    top_s.cash (past): +10.00 PLN
  pad: zs 2026-01-15 start, pads:statement_01:zs@2026-01-15 start of -25.00 PLN
