q_lean (d = 2026-01-20): (refused: RUN-TIE lean has a tie at lean[first, 2026-01], lean[second, 2026-01] that changes the result, and no ties by, refused: RUN-TIE lean has a tie at lean[first, 2026-01], lean[second, 2026-01] that changes the result, and no ties by)
