unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: PLN

index ks = 0 .. 50

place konto: claims PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..

input d0: date

input dd: date

input cap: money PLN

def rec[k in ks]: money PLN = if pos(k) == 1 then bal(konto, d0) else rec[k - 1]

def deep[k in ks]: money PLN = if pos(k) == 1 then bal(konto, dd) else deep[k - 1]

move dec: pays
  on dd
  reads konto
  leg cash from konto to world amount rec[50] + cap

ask a_late: bal(konto, dd)

ask b_early: bal(konto, d0)

ask c_rec: rec[50]

ask z_deep: deep[30]

